ent guide](https://docs.browsertrix.com/deploy/) for more info how to deploy Browsertrix.\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* chore: Fix npm scripts + update frontend dev docs by @SuaYoo in https://github.com/webrecorder/browsertrix/pull/3727\r\n* quickfix: add --saveState never to crawl args by @ikreymer in https://github.com/webrecorder/browsertrix/pull/3728\r\n* Add origins filter to browser profile list endpoint by @tw4l in https://github.com/webrecorder/browsertrix/pull/3688\r\n* devex: Format EJS by @SuaYoo in https://github.com/webrecorder/browsertrix/pull/3723\r\n* build: Pass static settings to frontend by @SuaYoo in https://github.com/webrecorder/browsertrix/pull/3724\r\n* devex: Refactor frontend to use static settings by @SuaYoo in https://github.com/webrecorder/browsertrix/pull/3726\r\n* Move docs to Zensical by @ikreymer in https://github.com/webrecorder/browsertrix/pull/3729\r\n* convert docs card links to lists by @emma-sg in https://github.com/webrecorder/browsertrix/pull/3735\r\n* docs: add additional smart scoping by @mistydemeo in https://github.com/webrecorder/browsertrix/pull/3662\r\n* feat: Add robots.txt by @SuaYoo in https://github.com/webrecorder/browsertrix/pull/3731\r\n* feat: Improve usability of embedded user guide by @SuaYoo in https://github.com/webrecorder/browsertrix/pull/3736\r\n* feat: Open external docs links in new tab by @SuaYoo in https://github.com/webrecorder/browsertrix/pull/3742\r\n* devex: Add archived items to Storybook by @SuaYoo in https://github.com/webrecorder/browsertrix/pull/3628\r\n* ensure backend test files are also formatted/linted by @emma-sg in https://github.com/webrecorder/browsertrix/pull/3746\r\n* analytics: Track usage and trial status by @SuaYoo in https://github.com/webrecorder/browsertrix/pull/3749\r\n* CI fixes for MongoDB by @ikreymer in https://github.com/webrecorder/browsertrix/pull/3758\r\n* ensure default behaviorTimeout and pageLoadTimeout from helm chart are set by @ikreymer in https://github.com/webrecorder/browsertrix/pull/3755\r\n* Ensure GET endpoints for pages, crawler channels, and crawling proxies allow viewer permissions by @tw4l in https://github.com/webrecorder/browsertrix/pull/3759\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/webrecorder/browsertrix/compare/v1.26.1...v1.26.2","mentions_count":5}]